ia.controls.airplane=W/S: push/pull  A/D: steer  Jump/Sneak: throttle  Attack: fire  Jump+Sneak: dismount
ia.controls.all=Steer with A/D (left stick). Airplanes: W pushes the nose down, S pulls it up, Jump/Sneak raise and lower the throttle (Sneak also brakes on the ground). Helicopters and airships: W/S fly forward/back, Jump/Sneak climb and descend. The gyrodyne needs you to hold W to spin the rotor up. Left click (attack) with an empty hand fires weapons, the telescope zooms while held. Use a firework rocket to burn the rockets in the boost slot. Press Jump and Sneak together to dismount (twice while airborne). Sneak + interact opens the inventory; sneak + interact while holding an upgrade, weapon, fuel, rocket, banner or dye installs it. Right click a damaged aircraft to repair it. /ia:aircraft opens this panel.
